    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Pronunciation approximations",
     "texto": [
      "The pronunciation written with English spelling is only a help: stress and soft sounds are not shown exactly. Unstressed vowels can change their sound depending on their position; for example, the **о** often sounds close to «a» in **она**.",
      "Two very common words have a reading that is worth learning in full: **что** (what) is said «shto» and **пожалуйста** (please), «pah-ZHAHL-stah»."
